  "upload": {
    "title": "How Does a Driverless Car See Danger Coming? 🚗 #shorts",
    "description": "How does a car with nobody at the wheel dodge boxes falling off a truck? 🚗\n\nWaymo's robotaxis combine three kinds of sensors: lidar fires millions of laser pulses to paint a 3D map, 29 cameras give a simultaneous 360° view, and radar measures distance and speed even in rain or a dust storm. The top half of these clips is what the Waymo Driver sees: every person and car becomes a shape, and the AI predicts the many paths each one might take, which is why it moves over before the skater even falls.\n\nNever tired, never angry, never texting at a red light. 👇\n\nSubscribe to Top Techs for more mind-blowing tech in under a minute.",
